      "cause": "Removing false whole-attention norm exclusions exposes the explicitly requested precision. Original OK rows were incorrectly querying BF16 attention. No matching DSA silicon exists for these overridden modes.",
      "disposition": "Retain DATA_MISS; do not override the user request, restore wrong BF16 lookup, weaken comparison thresholds or remove grid cases. The remaining precision/data coverage transition needs review; this is not a claim of a green prediction gate."
    }
